# Digital DNA — environment template
#
# This app is Local-first and server-less. It builds and runs with NO
# environment variables at all. Everything below is optional.
#
# Copy to `.env` only if you need to override a default. Never commit `.env`.

# Base public path. Defaults to `/digital-dna/` for a GitHub Pages project site.
# Use `/` when deploying to a domain root (Vercel, Netlify, Cloudflare Pages at
# a custom domain) or to a user/organisation Pages site (`<user>.github.io`).
VITE_BASE=/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Not used, on purpose
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# There is deliberately no variable for an AI API key. AI is an optional,
# user-configured feature: the key is entered in the app's Settings screen and
# stored only in the visitor's own browser (IndexedDB). It is never baked into
# the bundle, never read from the environment, and never sent to a backend,
# because this project has no backend.
